{"timestamp":"2025-09-09T11:54:39.963Z","level":"info","message":"POST to https://www.terragonlabs.com/api/daemon-event","data":{"url":"https://www.terragonlabs.com/api/daemon-event","body":"{\"messages\":[{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_01SaQS9MTL15DxihZe9qjGaX\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"哇！非常有意思的发现！从系统信息看出：\\n\\n1. **Hypervisor detected: KVM** - 这是KVM虚拟化！\\n2. **clocksource=kvm-clock** - 使用KVM时钟源\\n3. **Booting paravirtualized kernel on KVM** - 在KVM上运行半虚拟化内核\\n4. **root=/dev/vda** - 使用virtio磁盘\\n5. **virtio_mmio.device** - virtio MMIO设备\\n6. **pci=off** - PCI关闭（这很像Firecracker的特征！）\\n7. **hypervisor** flag 在CPU flags中\\n\\n看起来这很可能是 **Firecracker microVM**！Firecracker 是基于 KVM 的，但使用 virtio-mmio 而不是 PCI，并且通常会禁用 PCI。让我继续检查更多特征。\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":13,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1447,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":99271,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":1447,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":10,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"bf7d11f5-c3be-4905-8cef-fe6ab8c5f6df\",\"uuid\":\"ce1d5e8a-16ab-449a-a752-20de7bbd7b2f\"},{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_01SaQS9MTL15DxihZe9qjGaX\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01B5WRsd4PogrtbAbfDt4TSd\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cat /proc/meminfo | head -5\",\"description\":\"Check memory configuration\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":13,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1447,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":99271,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":1447,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":10,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"b